00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.320
also, the reliability
and security you

00:02:51.320 --> 00:02:53.870
need to run your mission
critical applications.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.510
Compute Engine also tries
to offer you everything

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.390
