based on business requirements
with the flexibility

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.860
to adapt as your
workload changes.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:15.450
You can get access to a variety
of predefined and customizable

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:16.600
